== Phase B: 4M-fact capacity crossover ==

Note on exposures at 4M facts: 9000 steps x 64 seqs x 16 facts/seq = 9.2M
fact-slots over 4.19M distinct facts = ~2.3 exposures/fact on average (zipf
random). Meta needed many more exposures, but dense ceiling at 4M is ~0 and
pool-only has 268M value params for 4.2M facts (~67 params/fact) — capacity
is not the binding constraint; routing is. If pool-only learns here, the
attribution question is answered at crossover scale.

